Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:32:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/14] Add controller-scoped exile count parser

Vren's end-step X now uses battlefield-to-exile zone-change records filtered by type and last-known controller. Gate B: reuse the parse_number_of_creatures_died_this_turn and parse_entered_this_turn_ref patterns; Cruel Calculations' origin-scoped graveyard quantity uses the same ZoneChangeCountThisTurn building block. The runtime scenario uses Vren, Shock, and Swords to Plowshares Oracle text and distinguishes controller from owner.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
